    description: After a time paradox, this helmet is now found during <b>Prehistory</b>.
  - period: 1
    description: After a time paradox, this helmet is now used as a planter during
      <b>Antiquity</b>.
  - period: 2
    description: This helmet allowed valourous <b>knights</b> to protect their perfect
      hairstyle throughout the dark times.
  - period: 3
    description: After a time paradox, <b>nobles</b> now ask their servants to wear
      this helmet when they can't stand to see their face.
